From 9dd0bad11ad9ede5199ff3b64b30e0d5bcaede94 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 11:05:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 19/22] ASP: async draw for Xexex; per-thread state and
 capture/bind for K056832, K053247, K053250, K054338, K053251 and the Konami
 mixing bitmaps

Harness, 2400 frames: render-thread pictures identical to inline at all ten
checkpoints (modes 1 and 2), sound hash identical, emulation waited twice.
X-Men, Mystic Warriors, Moo Mesa, Sunset Riders frame hashes unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JCu91LrG764XV67j6TkDrQ
